' Diagram 4: What a blocked user sees next (no event involved)
@startuml 04-blocked-user-next-request
actor "Blocked host" as H
participant JWTFilter as F
participant CustomUserDetailsDaoService as UD
database "users table" as DB

H -> F : any request with the cookie
F -> UD : loadUserByUsername(userId)
UD -> DB : select user
UD --> F : UserDetails (disabled = !isActive)
F -> F : isEnabled() is false
F --> H : 401 {code: ACCOUNT_BLOCKED}\n+ cookie cleared
note right of F
  The user is re-read on every request,
  so blocking takes effect immediately.
end note
@enduml